# This repo is consumed as the `nova` named build context by ldraw-nova-docker
# (COPY --from=nova ...). Named contexts don't use the other repo's
# .dockerignore, so without this file the whole checkout — .git included — is
# transferred to the daemon on every build.
#
# Keep this in sync with the `COPY --from=nova` lines in ldraw-nova-docker's
# Dockerfile: data/, docs/, examples/, prompts/, ldraw_tools/, and the
# top-level *.md *.py *.sh LICENSE CC-BY-SA-4.0 ldraw-agent.
.git
.obsidian
.vscode
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
tests
img
*.jpg
